# Baton state is project handoff data and must be committed.
# Do not add a generic ".baton/" rule here.
#
# This repository is Baton's own source, so .baton/bin/ would be a seventh
# copy of a binary that bootstrap/.baton/bin/ already ships for six platforms.
# Reinstall or rebuild it locally; everything else under .baton/ is committed.
/.baton/bin/
